DESCRIPTION:The annual celebration of beer\, music and good times returns t
 o South+East Brewing Co.\, where Indonesia’s celebrated craft beer brand
 s come together under one roof. OKTOBEERFEST Vol.4 takes place 9 – 10 Oc
 tober 2026. An event for beer lovers\, music enthusiasts\, and just about 
 anyone looking for a good time\, OKTOBEERFEST is a community festival wher
 e everyone is welcome. The two-day celebration will feature six participat
 ing breweries – Islands of Imagination (IoI)\, Island Brewing\, Black Sa
 nd Brewery\, Kult Beer\, Beaches Brewing Co.\, and Kura Kura – allowing 
