 s in one place. Alongside beers\, music is an important element at this an
 nual beer festival\, and this year’s headliners include live performance
 s from favourite Bali bands\, The Hydrant and Unbrocken\, with a roster of
  DJs also lined up to keep the atmosphere buzzing across both days.\n\nMor
 e info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/oktobeerfest-vol-4-at-so
