SUMMARY:LUNA'S - JUNGLE OF THE DAMNED - HALLOWEEN SPECIAL
LOCATION:Luna Beach Club\, Jl. Kayangan\, Beraban\, Kec. Kediri Tabanan
DESCRIPTION:🎃🔥 LUNA'S - JUNGLE OF THE DAMNED - HALLOWEEN SPECIAL 🔥
 🎃 Welcome to Bali's Wildest Halloween Festival at Luna Beach Club! YOU'
 VE FOUND YOUR FREE GUEST LIST RIGHTB HERE! Step into the shadows... On Sat
 uday October 31st\, 2026\, the gates to the Jungle of the Damned swing ope
 n at Luna Beach Club\, Bali’s #1 destination for unforgettable parties. 
 This is not just another Halloween event – it's a festival-style\, multi
 -stage extravaganza fusing spine-tingling theatrics with electrifying musi
 c and all-out wildness! 🌴👻 🕺 4 Spectacular Stages • Non-Stop Mu
 sic & Madness 🎶 Prepare your soul (and your costume) for a full-throttl
 e ride through every corner of dance music – from Afro House to Tech\, F
 unky House to heart-thumping Drum & Bass. Our killer line-up includes: Mai
 n Stage: WALLY LOPEZ\, SERGIO CUCALON\, SAUL BLISS\, ISIDORA\, GLYNN TANDY
  Pukka Up Stage: DAN COOK\, NEBS\, HANTAREJA\, ACRUSE Utopia Cave Club: PI
 CCO\, KILL BILL (B2B) GUY LIKE RY\, SEAN DOYLE w/ SYDNEY JO JACKSON LIVE S
 ET Sky Lounge Stage: GENERAL RIE (SUNSET LIQUID DRUM AND BASS SET) Get rea
 dy for non-stop beats\, epic drops\, and sets that will tear the roof off 
 – all set amidst the beautiful\, haunting vistas of Luna Beach Club! 
 🌊👾 🦇 Halloween Like Never Before – Enter the Jungle of Surprise
 s! 🦇 This is where you ditch the ordinary and embrace the extraordinary
 . Expect: Huge prizes for the Best Fancy Dress – so go wild! (Bring your
  most bone-chilling\, jaw-dropping costumes 🧛🧟‍♂️) Interactive
  actors & dancers lurking in the shadows\, ready to give you chills and th
